{
  "id": "JDG.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Jothum Banja 19",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jalevi kodi malaya pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo i hongo no, munyo kere oyido ongoye i Isiraili, aka obedo jal moro ma Jalevi, m'oyido lera iy'adec ma kakende ma piny matendere Efrayim, onywomo malaya ma wok i Bethelehem i Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To malaya pere omako gine, to weyo go kadho i ot pa bamere i Bethelehem i Yuda, to bedo kenyo ma dwe aŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo cwore oay malo to kidho cako rango go, ma luwo gi cunye ma dwoko go. Oyido go nitie gi ŋeca pere kodi punde kweth. Dheno okelo go i ot pa bamere, bamere oneno go to bino gi kisangala romo gi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore, ba cege, odiyo go, to miyo go bedo gine ma ndelo adek; ameno jocemo to jomedho, jok'obilo nindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'aŋwen joay odikin maŋic, to joyikere ma kadho; to ba nyako waco ri ore ni, “Yom cuny gi cemo nyaka mathi, aka k'itieko nyaka t'ikadho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno cwo ario no jobedo piny, jocemo to jomedho kanyacel; to ba nyako waco ri jalo ni, “Mondo raŋo ikinindi to cunyin yodere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jalo oay ma kadho, to ba cege medo ywakere rigo cuka onindo kenyo kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'abic go ocew odikin maŋic kadho, to ba nyaka waco ni, “Mondo siem cunyin.” Ameno to jokuro cuka piny oyutho, to joje jocemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jalo gi malaya pere kodi ŋeca pere joay kadho, ore, ba nyako, owaco rigo ni, “Mondo neni, piny oyutho ma lokirok othieno. Mondo nindi. Neni, piny oyutho. Nindi ka aka weyi cunyin wosangala. Dikin inyalo cew odikin maŋic t'imako yo perin, t'ikadho peco perin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jalo k'omito nindo kenyo kendo; oay to kadho, to tundo kam'oŋiyere gi Yebus (meno, Yerusalem.) Go oyido nitie gi punde ario m'igweyo, aka malaya pere oyido nitie gi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oyido jocegin tundo Yebus, sawa oyido okadho, to ŋeca waco ri jadwoŋ pere ni, “Mondo biye, weyi wawire yuthengi tindi madwoŋ pa Joyebus me, to wanind'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jadwoŋ pere waco rigo ni, “Wak'owire yuthengi tindi madwoŋ pa jokicar, ma jok'obedo Joisiraili; to walamedere kiri Gibeya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go owaco ri ŋeca pere ni, “Biye, weyi watem tundo iy'acel kwoŋ kabedo me, to wanindo i Gibeya kosa i Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jomedere to jokadho i yo pajo; to waŋceŋ podho rijo cegin i Gibeya, m'obedo apa Benyamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowire gi thenge kenyo, ma donjo kodi nindo i Gibeya. Go odonjo to bedo i kam'othangere ma tindi madwoŋ, to ongoye ŋat'otero jo nindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo won othieno obedo jal moro m'oti m'oyido dwoko wok i tic pere i ndelo. Jalo oyido wok i piny matendere ma Efrayim, aka go oyido bedo i Gibeya. (Cwo ma kenyo oyido jobedo wot Benyamin.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jalo otiŋo waŋe malo to neno ŋata wotho i kam'othangere ma tindi madwoŋ, jal m'oti no openjo go ni, “Ikidho kune aka iwok kune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalevi odwoko go ni, “Waluwo wok i Yerusalem i Yuda iy'adec mabor loyo ma piny matendere ma Yuda, kam'awok'iye. Awok i Bethelehem i Yuda; aka onyo akadho i Ot pa Rwoth. Ongoye jal m'ojolan i ot pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan ŋecin perin wanitie gi kanja gi lum m'othwo ri punde mawan, gi cemo kodi vini ri an kodi ri ŋeca perin madhako kodi ri jayac manitie gi wan. Wakimiti gimoro kendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jal m'oti no owaco ni, “Siem wobedi kodin. Alamiyin gimoro je m'imito; nyaka ikir'inindi kam'othangere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno go okelo jo i ot pere, to pidho punde; jolwoko tiendi jo, aka jocemo to jomedho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oyido fodi josiemere, cwo ma tindi madwoŋ, wot ji ma bukony, jothoko ot, to jocako goyo thigo gi derino. Jowaco ri jalo, jadwoŋ ma ot ni, “Wodhi woko jal m'obino i ot perin, ŋey wanyal nindo gi go.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jalo, jadwoŋ ma ot, wok woko bongi jo to waco rijo ni, “Be, wutmera, mondo wikiri witim gikidakana. Paka jame obedo wendo paran, wikiri witim giwickwot ma miŋo me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E nyaran mambula gi malaya pere; mondo weyi awodhi jo woko. Nindi win gi jo to witimo gi jo gima wimito; to ri jal me wikiri witim giwickwot me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To cwo no jok'onyalo winjo go. Ameno jalo opodho kwoŋ malaya pere, to wodho go woko rijo. Jonindo gine m'ongoye wor gipi cuka otundo odikin. Aka munyo ŋamba oriedo, to joweyo go kadho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo piny oyawere, dheno obino podho i dhiot ma ot kama jadwoŋ pere oyido nitie iye, cuka piny olokere maler. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odikin jadwoŋ pere ay to yawo thigin ma ot, aka munyo owok kadho i yo pere, malaya pere oyido nitie onindo i dhiot ma ot, gi cinge kwoŋ thigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco rigo ni, “Ay malo wakadhi.” To radwok ngoye. Kenyo jalo oketho go i wi punda; to jalo ay kadho peco pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo go otundo peco pere, okwanyo apala to podho kwoŋ malaya pere to ŋundo go mathindho thindho muma apar g'ario, tundo i coko, to dhiro go woko iy'adec je ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi dhano je m'oneno go onyalo waco ni, “Oyido fodi nger gime k'otimere, oyido nger gime fodi k'onenere wok i ndelo ma Joisiraili jowey'iye Misir cuka tundo ndelo me! Waripo timo gimoro kwoŋe. Warangi rieko, to wawodho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
